---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Sci Art Club"
    description="Sci Art Club: a community for people who make art about science, and science that looks like art."
>
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
                <span class="font-silkscreen font-normal">Sci Art Club</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                <span class="font-silkscreen">Sci Art Club</span> is a community for
                people who make art about science, and science that looks like art.
                Whether you draw specimens, print from microscope slides, sew
                orbital mechanics, or just love a good anatomical plate, you've
                found your people.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- TODO: lead image (tcplot uses a collage here) -->

        <!-- About Section -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12">
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                We meet to look closely and make things, through three core pillars:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-1 text-gray-400">&#x25B8;</span>
                    <span><strong class="text-gray-900">Talks:</strong> Hear from
                        scientists and artists about how they see, and how they
                        show what they see.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-1 text-gray-400">&#x25B8;</span>
                    <span><strong class="text-gray-900">Workshops:</strong> Hands-on
                        sessions in scientific illustration, printmaking, field
                        sketching, and whatever else we can get our hands on.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-1 text-gray-400">&#x25B8;</span>
                    <span><strong class="text-gray-900">Studio sessions:</strong>
                        Bring a project and work alongside others turning
                        specimens, data, and ideas into art.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- TODO: Instagram / Meetup links once the accounts exist -->
    </div>
</Layout>
